    <briefdescription>
<para>A single monophonic voice. Multiple tracks are mixed together by speaker_play_tracks() to produce polyphony. notes: array of notes to play sequentially. num_notes: length of the notes array. sample: if non-NULL, notes are played by pitch-shifting this sample; note.waveform is ignored. If NULL, notes use their waveform field. </para>
    </briefdescription>
